# the shelf: filters, covers, progress, the book menu, opening where reading stopped
1 shot all
LEFT shot reading_empty
RIGHT RIGHT shot done_empty
# read both books a little
LEFT 5 DOWN DOWN RSOFT shot pdf_after
DOWN 5 3 RSOFT shot rich_after
LEFT shot reading
# the book menu: mark as read
LSOFT shot menu
5 shot marked
RIGHT RIGHT shot done
# back to the main menu and in again: the shelf opens on the books being read
RSOFT RSOFT 1 shot reopen
5 shot continued
# delete: the book is marked (make update-data deletes it) and goes to "На удаление",
# a shelf there while a book is marked; "Не удалять" brings it back
RSOFT LSOFT DOWN DOWN 5 shot del_marked
LEFT shot del_shelf
LSOFT DOWN DOWN 5 shot del_undone
